    "sections": {
        "description": "Flex Real Estate theme offers a complete and professional solution for building real estate websites for agents, brokers, developers, and property consultants. With One Click Demo Import, it’s easy to launch your property portal in minutes. This Elementor-compatible, fully responsive theme includes a customizable banner section, property listings, and easy property management tools—perfect for showcasing residential, commercial, or luxury properties. Integrated with popular plugins like Easy Property Listings, Contact Form 7, and Elementor, it enables seamless property submissions, lead generation, and client inquiries. Whether you’re a real estate company, property advisor, housing developer, or mortgage consultant, Flex Real Estate provides the ideal foundation for your real estate marketplace, property portal, or investment platform. It’s designed to support real estate agencies, property dealers, real estate consultants, and real estate marketing firms looking to highlight apartments, villas, plots for sale, office spaces, retail leasing, or vacation rentals. With SEO-optimized layouts, high-speed performance, and a clean design, this theme helps improve real estate lead generation, property branding, and search visibility. Build your real estate website with Flex Real Estate and showcase every property listing with elegance, clarity, and functionality."
    },
